From 97420f32be3693663ff760c7a6ca7aa56fd99a46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bare <git@barebrowser.org>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 22:23:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add MicroG account and token support

Integrate the account and token APIs exposed by standard MicroG, ReVanced, and MicroG-RE. Restore sync invalidation delivery while preserving package identity checks.
